{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8000_place", "source_sha256": "85f1b218b3f2cf0ef8051cfacf91c54b9197e58207b0d14eb10096e4b0d8e288", "ja": "交差点", "zh": "十字路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8001_p", "source_sha256": "4272f450c3ce659b5a341c64adf4920a8a51a7d6e9c496af0a5b5a935fed1f03", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\nこのみさんは交通課の警察官のテーマで撮影をする）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，\n这次要以交通科警察官为主题给此方拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8002_039kon", "source_sha256": "80e79a3ea28a34306e1bb0508345c77e5aa706e6710ced70544a29c8b26610d8", "ja": "う～ん、いいじゃない！\nアダルティな警察官役、私にぴったりのお仕事ね！", "zh": "嗯～，不错嘛！\n成熟风警察官的角色，这份工作真适合我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8003_039kon", "source_sha256": "7db9598fe730a9d7437793bdf589974c645fa3a55f0b7f42545f61f9e7fe00d7", "ja": "「君も逮捕しちゃうぞ♪」なーんて！　あ、でも、\n交通課だから……ちょっとイメージが違うかしら？", "zh": "“把你也给逮捕起来哦♪”开玩笑啦！啊，不过，\n既然是交通课的话……形象会不会有点不太一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8004_p", "source_sha256": "b6e34bb277e1c946c159770cde3b5a15021bff234f19b6e025fddf2804a866b8", "ja": "そうですね。あくまで日常業務に焦点をあてた方が、\nよりイメージしやすいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "是啊。还是把重点放在日常工作上，或许会更容易让人理解吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8005_039kon", "source_sha256": "70f9fbcce2dec6c281660f6d0e921ffa43147ed5d186b5afdd6d23a9a5c561b9", "ja": "やっぱり、そうよね……。ほら、ドラマとかだと\n捜査をしたり、凶悪犯に立ち向かう印象じゃない。", "zh": "果然是这样呢……你看，电视剧里\n大都是去搜查啊、直面凶恶犯人之类的印象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8006_039kon", "source_sha256": "445a465ebd7de1395bccb9c09f2eab42600ec9c3f29ed06f1ad3e6a0a0b40993", "ja": "だから、警察官の日常業務って言われると……。\n{$P$}は、なにか思いつく？", "zh": "所以，一说到警察的日常工作……{$P$}先生，你能想到什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8007", "source_sha256": "60f8653d9ccf51e85b5a2bfc625dfbaa2f1e1f18b6c1e5c764f6aa1ec49aff85", "ja": "市民への案内", "zh": "面向市民的通知", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8008", "source_sha256": "58c48ef5e7e11dbb5efd611c7beef353e69ddeb15c820f560046b8ac55dee695", "ja": "違反の取り締まり", "zh": "查处违规行为", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8009", "source_sha256": "545388d26842c26169fb286cc5baceff539aabb726327ed1c67e942f94cebb0a", "ja": "カーチェイス", "zh": "追车戏", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8100_p", "source_sha256": "eae57aed8faa4808627e8644f1fcf155c2510b40d08900b505ee2b6271897576", "ja": "道を教えたり、交通ルールやマナーを指導したり……。\nそういうのをアピールするのはどうですか？", "zh": "比如教人怎么走，指导交通规则和礼仪……。宣传这些怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8101_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ad9e8539cf786eac8ba554cadceea8897bd1724c2e51691087cbbe2af1ca97d", "ja": "あら、いいじゃないそれ♪　やっぱりアダルティな女は\nみんなから頼りにされちゃうものよね。", "zh": "哎呀，这主意不错嘛♪成熟女人果然会受到大家的依赖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8102_039kon", "source_sha256": "209dd3511170831261848a54e284b9cdcc4ad45bc4dd51a81ced957b70b58577", "ja": "それじゃ、やってみようかしら。迷った人の役は……\n{$P$}、お願いしてもいい？", "zh": "那么，就来试试看吧。迷路的人这个角色……\n{$P$}，可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8200_p", "source_sha256": "8e06f5e43c9567dd1529cf41d614794b55b9e7426668bc23cafff27b7b52ef96", "ja": "交通違反の取り締まり、ですかね。\nやはり、交通に関するイメージは鉄板だと思うんです。", "zh": "应该是查处交通违章吧。\n我觉得，果然和交通有关的形象最稳妥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8201_039kon", "source_sha256": "8b6c4507c2c69203152a8ed303013a7afabd53dd003533ac4438f21fbb73b724", "ja": "なるほど。それなら……「そこの車、止まりなさーい！\nスピード違反よ。免許証を見せてもらうわ」……とか？", "zh": "原来如此。那样的话……“那边的车，停下来——！你超速了。请出示驾照”……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8202_039kon", "source_sha256": "18322d097777200261a8e675eaf4b66c3cef715978eedb26f18410ece44ded5a", "ja": "いつもは免許証を提示する側だから……\nちょっとだけ、新鮮な気分ね。うふふ♪", "zh": "平时都是我出示驾照给别人看……\n感觉还挺新鲜的呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8300_p", "source_sha256": "df274fda635990d030ca7755188feab3f036d4ffe1f68755922f2740e9b5e40d", "ja": "カーチェイスなら絵になるかもしれませんね。\n真剣な表情や、かっこいいところも見せられますし！", "zh": "要是追车的话，说不定会很上镜呢。\n也能展现认真表情和帅气的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8301_039kon", "source_sha256": "25c6923753a362df086433dc197c9f311a8488923e8a82341de223ee2343ff12", "ja": "うーん、たしかにそうなんだけど……。\nカーチェイスって日常的にあるものかしら？", "zh": "嗯……确实是这样没错，可是……\n追车在日常生活中会发生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_8302_039kon", "source_sha256": "e1e905fbc6ea8a0bcbcad4d7881251b4a9317e96bc05f76751cf714cd771c293", "ja": "さっき話してたコンセプトとも少し違うような……\nごめんなさい、もう少し考えてみるわね。", "zh": "好像和刚才说的概念也有点不一样……\n对不起，我再稍微想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
